caption: GATES Setting Rules — HT
technology-rule: ht

The soft cap on HT added to an existing biological character by ordinary cybernetics is 2 × (TL − 8): +2 at TL9, +4 at TL10, +6 at TL11, and +8 at TL12. Reaching this cap requires systemic reinforcement or replacement of the body’s load-bearing, circulatory, respiratory, thermal-control, waste-handling, organ, immune, endocrine, and repair systems as appropriate.

This HT cap does not necessarily limit a full machine-body racial template or total-conversion chassis, which uses the chassis and template rules instead of adding HT to an otherwise biological body. Superscience, supernatural sources, and explicit Tradition permissions may exceed the ordinary cap.
